        "@value": "Franco 5 &#8211; 7 &#8211; November"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;🇫🇷 5 à 7 FRANCO – NOVEMBRE Join us for friendly exchanges between Francophones, Francophiles and one interested in the francophonie every 3rd Friday of the month. On the menu: moments of pleasure, a glass of wine and small bites. Next meeting: Friday, November 21st , 5:00 PM to 7:00 PM Location: Société francophone de [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
    ],
